Package: autobricks-dns
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~), systemd
Description: Lightweight internal DNS override and forwarding service
 Serves configured A and AAAA records and forwards other names to an upstream
 DNS server. Includes a local Unix-socket management CLI and a systemd unit.
 Configure the service before explicitly enabling and starting it.
